title: $:/plugins/rimir/outline/ui/help-bar
description: The ? button and, while $:/temp/rimir/outline/help/<title> is yes, the key overview of an outline. Transcluded inline by ui/body (variable ol-help: that temp tiddler), outside the $outline widget.

\whitespace trim
<div class="rr-ol-help-bar">
<$button class="tc-btn-invisible rr-ol-help-button" tooltip="Keys (?)" aria-label="Keys">
<%if [<ol-help>get[text]match[yes]] %>
<$action-deletetiddler $tiddler=<<ol-help>>/>
<%else%>
<$action-setfield $tiddler=<<ol-help>> text="yes"/>
<%endif%>
?
</$button>
<%if [<ol-help>get[text]match[yes]] %>
<div class="rr-ol-help">
<$button class="tc-btn-invisible rr-ol-help-close" tooltip="Close (Escape)" aria-label="Close">
<$action-deletetiddler $tiddler=<<ol-help>>/>
{{$:/core/images/close-button}}
</$button>
<$transclude $tiddler="$:/plugins/rimir/outline/ui/keys-table" $mode="block"/>
</div>
<%endif%>
</div>
